title: "ns3-tools"
abstract: >-
  Protocol-agnostic ns-3 comparison and diagnostics tooling: the routing-bench
  harness every protocol arm registers with, the readers and paired statistics
  for its marker lines behind the ns3-tool CLI, the ns3-campaign driver, and
  (planned) probes and universal arenas.
